Graphics Draw_Rect Options_Background 0.0 0.0 960.0 540.0 18 18 28 255
Graphics GUI_Begin Options_Menu
Graphics GUI_Text Options_Title "Options"
Graphics GUI_Button Graphics_Options Graphics None
Graphics GUI_Button Audio_Options Audio None
Graphics GUI_Button Controls_Options Controls None
Graphics GUI_Button Back_From_Options Back None
Graphics GUI_End

Graphics GUI_Button_Clicked Back_From_Options
Set_Var_Global Back_From_Options_Clicked GUI.Back_From_Options.Clicked
If Var Back_From_Options_Clicked == 1
{
	Set_Var Game_State Bananas/Game_Over
}

Return
